# Pattern 1 : DFS (General Traversal)

## Template

```java
void dfs(TreeNode root){

    if(root == null){
        return;
    }

    // Process Node

    dfs(root.left);

    dfs(root.right);
}
```

### Process Node me kya aayega?

Situation ke hisaab se:

```java
System.out.print(root.val);      // Print

count++;                         // Count Nodes

sum += root.val;                 // Sum

list.add(root.val);              // Store Answer

if(root.val == target)           // Search
```

### Kab Use Hoga?

Question me likha ho:

* Traverse Tree
* Search Node
* Count Nodes
* Sum of Nodes
* Print Tree
* Find Target

Recognition:

```text
