# Pattern 6 : Level Order

```java
while(!queue.isEmpty()){

    int size = queue.size();

    List<Integer> level =
        new ArrayList<>();

    for(int i = 0; i < size; i++){

        TreeNode current =
            queue.poll();

        level.add(current.val);

        if(current.left != null)
            queue.offer(current.left);

        if(current.right != null)
            queue.offer(current.right);
    }

    answer.add(level);
}
```

### Process Node

```java
